{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
		"name": "Sukrtya Siwan",
		"description": "Sukrtya Siwan backend API.\n\n| Area | Method | Path | Auth |\n|------|--------|------|------|\n| Login | POST | `/api/auth/login` | None (JSON body) |\n| Current user | GET | `/api/auth/me` | Bearer JWT (folder **Me (JWT)**) |\n| Master roster | GET | `/api/me/master-context` | Bearer JWT |\n| Dashboard summary | GET | `/api/admin/dashboard/summary` | None (dev; `/api/admin/**` is open) |\n| Excel import | POST | `/api/admin/masters/import-excel` | None (multipart `file`) |\n\n**`{{baseUrl}}`** → `http://localhost:8081` by default (`server.port`).\n\n**Token:** Run **Login — admin** or **Login — CHO**; Tests save `{{accessToken}}`. Requests under **Me (JWT)** inherit Bearer auth from the folder.\n\n**Credentials:** `{{adminUsername}}` / `{{adminPassword}}`; CHO `{{choUsername}}` (10-digit mobile) / `{{choPassword}}`.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"auth": {
		"type": "noauth"
	},
	"variable": [
		{
			"key": "baseUrl",
			"value": "http://localhost:8081",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "API root (scheme + host + port)."
		},
		{
			"key": "accessToken",
			"value": "",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "Filled by Login requests (Tests). Used by Me (JWT) folder Bearer auth."
		},
		{
			"key": "adminUsername",
			"value": "admin",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "adminPassword",
			"value": "Admin@123",
			"type": "string"
		},
		{
			"key": "choUsername",
			"value": "9999999999",
			"type": "string",
			"description": "10-digit portal username (CHO mobile from import)."
		},
		{
			"key": "choPassword",
			"value": "User@123",
			"type": "string"
		}
	],
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Auth",
			"description": "Public. Successful login stores `accessToken` on the collection.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Login — admin",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json && json.accessToken) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", json.accessToken);",
									"        console.log(\"Saved accessToken. role=\", json.role, \"expiresInSeconds=\", json.expiresInSeconds);",
									"    }",
									"} else {",
									"    console.log(\"Login failed:\", pm.response.code, pm.response.text());",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{adminUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
						"description": "`POST /api/auth/login` — JSON `username`, `password`. Response: `accessToken`, `tokenType`, `expiresInSeconds`, `role`, `username`, `displayName`."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Login — CHO (data collector)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    const json = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (json && json.accessToken) {",
									"        pm.collectionVariables.set(\"accessToken\", json.accessToken);",
									"        console.log(\"Saved accessToken. role=\", json.role);",
									"    }",
									"} else {",
									"    console.log(\"Login failed:\", pm.response.code, pm.response.text());",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"auth": {
							"type": "noauth"
						},
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"{{choUsername}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{choPassword}}\"\n}"
						},
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
						"description": "Same path as admin login; username = CHO **mobile** (10 digits)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Me (JWT)",
			"description": "Bearer `{{accessToken}}` is set on **this folder** — child requests inherit it. Log in under **Auth** first.",
			"auth": {
				"type": "bearer",
				"bearer": [
					{
						"key": "token",
						"value": "{{accessToken}}",
						"type": "string"
					}
				]
			},
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get current user (me)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/me",
						"description": "`GET /api/auth/me` — `userId`, `username`, `displayName`, `role`. **401** if token missing/invalid."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get master context (districts, facilities, staff)",
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Accept",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/me/master-context",
						"description": "`GET /api/me/master-context` — `scope`, user fields, `facilities[]` (district, block, facility, `staff[]`, `supervisorAssignmentId` on ASHA)."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"name": "Admin",
			"description": "`/api/admin/**` is **permitAll** in dev (no JWT). Split: **Dashboard** vs **Masters**.",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Dashboard",
					"item": [
						{
							"name": "Dashboard summary (counts)",
							"request": {
								"auth": {
									"type": "noauth"
								},
								"method": "GET",
								"header": [
									{
										"key": "Accept",
										"value": "application/json"
									}
								],
								"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/dashboard/summary",
								"description": "`GET /api/admin/dashboard/summary` — `geography`, `activeStaffAssignmentsByRole`, `facilityWorkerAssignmentsByStatus`, `portalUserFacility`, `choAtActiveFacilities`, `healthWorkers`."
							},
							"response": []
						}
					]
				},
				{
					"name": "Masters",
					"item": [
						{
							"name": "Import master Excel",
							"request": {
								"auth": {
									"type": "noauth"
								},
								"method": "POST",
								"header": [
									{
										"key": "Accept",
										"value": "application/json"
									}
								],
								"body": {
									"mode": "formdata",
									"formdata": [
										{
											"key": "file",
											"description": "Roster `.xlsx` / `.xls`. Field name must be `file`.",
											"type": "file",
											"src": []
										}
									]
								},
								"url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/admin/masters/import-excel",
								"description": "`POST /api/admin/masters/import-excel` — multipart `file`. **200** / **400** JSON."
							},
							"response": []
						}
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
}
